  "title": "Editorial: Use CreateBuiltinFunction for (async) iterator return and next methods",
  "user": {
    "login": "nicolo-ribaudo",
    "id": 7000710,
    "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDA3MTA=",
